# Graphen

A simple, offline graphing app for iPhone and iPad.

## Privacy Policy

Graphen does not collect, store, transmit, or share any personal data. Period.

### What we collect

Nothing. Graphen has no accounts, no sign up, no analytics, no tracking, no advertising, and no third party SDKs that gather information. We do not know who you are, where you are, or how you use the app.

### Where your data lives

Everything you create in Graphen, such as your equations, graphs, and saved settings, stays on your device. It is never sent anywhere. If you delete the app, that data is deleted with it.

### Internet access

Graphen works fully offline. It does not connect to any server, so your information has no way to leave your device.

### Children

Graphen is safe for all ages. Because we collect no data from anyone, we also collect no data from children.

### Third parties

There are none. No ads, no analytics providers, no social logins, no external services.

### Changes

If this policy ever changes, the updated version will appear in the app and on this page. Since Graphen collects nothing, we do not expect it to change.

