## Support

Thanks for using Graphen. Here is everything you need to know.

### Getting started

Open the app and type an equation to see it plotted instantly. Use pinch to zoom and drag to pan. Tap any curve to trace points and read exact coordinates.

### Frequently asked questions

**Do I need an account?**
No. Open the app and start graphing right away.

**Does Graphen work offline?**
Yes, fully. No internet connection is required at any point.

**Is my data sent anywhere?**
No. Everything stays on your device. See the Privacy Policy above for details.

**How do I delete my data?**
Delete the app. Since nothing is stored on any server, removing the app removes everything.

**The app is not plotting my equation correctly.**
Check your syntax and make sure you are using the supported function format. If it still looks wrong, send us the equation and we will take a look.

**How do I report a bug or request a feature?**
Email us at ensarigizem1230@gmail.com with a short description. Screenshots help.

### Contact

We read every message. Reach us at ensarigizem1230@gmail.com and we will get back to you as soon as we can.

